2563:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to literal @ref LL_ADC_DELAY_VREFINT_STAB_US.
2564:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to literal @ref LL_ADC_DELAY_TEMPSENSOR_STAB_US.
2565:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   ADC internal channel sampling time constraint:
