3655:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h **** /**
3656:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set ADC group regular sequence: channel on the selected
3657:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         scan sequence rank.
3658:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   This function performs configuration of:
3659:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         - Channels ordering into each rank of scan sequence:
3660:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *           whatever channel can be placed into whatever rank.
3661:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this SR5E1 series, ADC group regular sequencer is
3662:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         fully configurable: sequencer length and each rank
3663:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         affectation to a channel are configurable.
3664:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to description of function @ref LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerLength().
3665:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Depending on devices and packages, some channels may not be available.
3666:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to device datasheet for channels availability.
3667:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this SR5E1 series, to measure internal channels (VrefInt,
3668:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         TempSensor, ...), measurement paths to internal channels must be
3669:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         enabled separately.
3670:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         This can be done using function @ref LL_ADC_SetCommonPathInternalCh().
3671:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this SR5E1 series, setting of this feature is conditioned to
3672:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC state:
3673:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC must be disabled or enabled without conversion on going
3674:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         on group regular.
