 452:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c **** /**
 453:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @brief  De-initialize registers of the selected ADC instance
 454:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         to their default reset values.
 455:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   To reset all ADC instances quickly (perform a hard reset),
 456:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         use function @ref LL_ADC_CommonDeInit().
 457:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   If this functions returns error status, it means that ADC instance
 458:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         is in an unknown state.
 459:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         In this case, perform a hard reset using high level
 460:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         clock source RCC ADC reset.
 461:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         Caution: On this SR5E1 series, if several ADC instances are available
 462:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         on the selected device, RCC ADC reset will reset
 463:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         all ADC instances belonging to the common ADC instance.
 464:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         Refer to function @ref LL_ADC_CommonDeInit().
 465:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
 466:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @retval An ErrorStatus enumeration value:
 467:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - SUCCESS: ADC registers are de-initialized
 468:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - ERROR: ADC registers are not de-initialized
 469:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   */
