 713:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c **** /**
 714:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @brief  Initialize some features of ADC instance.
 715:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   These parameters have an impact on ADC scope: ADC instance.
 716:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         Affects both group regular and group injected (availability
 717:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         of ADC group injected depends on SR5E1 families).
 718:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         Refer to corresponding unitary functions into
 719:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         @ref ADC_LL_EF_Configuration_ADC_Instance .
 720:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   The setting of these parameters by function @ref LL_ADC_Init()
 721:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         is conditioned to ADC state:
 722:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         ADC instance must be disabled.
 723:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         This condition is applied to all ADC features, for efficiency
 724:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         and compatibility over all SR5E1 families. However, the different
 725:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         features can be set under different ADC state conditions
 726:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         (setting possible with ADC enabled without conversion on going,
 727:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         ADC enabled with conversion on going, ...)
 728:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         Each feature can be updated afterwards with a unitary function
 729:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         and potentially with ADC in a different state than disabled,
 730:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         refer to description of each function for setting
 731:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         conditioned to ADC state.
 732:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   After using this function, some other features must be configured
 733:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         using LL unitary functions.
 734:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         The minimum configuration remaining to be done is:
 735:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - Set ADC group regular or group injected sequencer:
 736:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *            map channel on the selected sequencer rank.
 737:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *            Refer to function @ref LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerRanks().
 738:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - Set ADC channel sampling time
 739:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *            Refer to function LL_ADC_SetChannelSamplingTime();
 740:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
 741:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @param  ADC_InitStruct Pointer to a @ref LL_ADC_REG_InitTypeDef structure
 742:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @retval An ErrorStatus enumeration value:
 743:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - SUCCESS: ADC registers are initialized
 744:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - ERROR: ADC registers are not initialized
 745:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   */
 746:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c **** ErrorStatus LL_ADC_Init(ADC_TypeDef *ADCx, LL_ADC_InitTypeDef *ADC_InitStruct)
