 801:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c **** /**
 802:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @brief  Initialize some features of ADC group regular.
 803:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   These parameters have an impact on ADC scope: ADC group regular.
 804:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         Refer to corresponding unitary functions into
 805:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         @ref ADC_LL_EF_Configuration_ADC_Group_Regular
 806:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         (functions with prefix "REG").
 807:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   The setting of these parameters by function @ref LL_ADC_Init()
 808:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         is conditioned to ADC state:
 809:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         ADC instance must be disabled.
 810:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         This condition is applied to all ADC features, for efficiency
 811:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         and compatibility over all SR5E1 families. However, the different
 812:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         features can be set under different ADC state conditions
 813:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         (setting possible with ADC enabled without conversion on going,
 814:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         ADC enabled with conversion on going, ...)
 815:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         Each feature can be updated afterwards with a unitary function
 816:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         and potentially with ADC in a different state than disabled,
 817:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         refer to description of each function for setting
 818:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         conditioned to ADC state.
 819:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   After using this function, other features must be configured
 820:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         using LL unitary functions.
 821:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         The minimum configuration remaining to be done is:
 822:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - Set ADC group regular or group injected sequencer:
 823:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *            map channel on the selected sequencer rank.
 824:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *            Refer to function @ref LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerRanks().
 825:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - Set ADC channel sampling time
 826:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *            Refer to function LL_ADC_SetChannelSamplingTime();
 827:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
 828:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @param  ADC_REG_InitStruct Pointer to a @ref LL_ADC_REG_InitTypeDef structure
 829:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @retval An ErrorStatus enumeration value:
 830:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - SUCCESS: ADC registers are initialized
 831:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - ERROR: ADC registers are not initialized
 832:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   */
 833:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c **** ErrorStatus LL_ADC_REG_Init(ADC_TypeDef *ADCx, LL_ADC_REG_InitTypeDef *ADC_REG_InitStruct)
