 934:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c **** /**
 935:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @brief  Initialize some features of ADC group injected.
 936:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   These parameters have an impact on ADC scope: ADC group injected.
 937:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         Refer to corresponding unitary functions into
 938:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         @ref ADC_LL_EF_Configuration_ADC_Group_Regular
 939:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         (functions with prefix "INJ").
 940:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   The setting of these parameters by function @ref LL_ADC_Init()
 941:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         is conditioned to ADC state:
 942:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         ADC instance must be disabled.
 943:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         This condition is applied to all ADC features, for efficiency
 944:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         and compatibility over all SR5E1 families. However, the different
 945:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         features can be set under different ADC state conditions
 946:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         (setting possible with ADC enabled without conversion on going,
 947:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         ADC enabled with conversion on going, ...)
 948:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         Each feature can be updated afterwards with a unitary function
 949:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         and potentially with ADC in a different state than disabled,
 950:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         refer to description of each function for setting
 951:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         conditioned to ADC state.
 952:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   After using this function, other features must be configured
 953:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         using LL unitary functions.
 954:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *         The minimum configuration remaining to be done is:
 955:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - Set ADC group injected sequencer:
 956:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *            map channel on the selected sequencer rank.
 957:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *            Refer to function @ref LL_ADC_INJ_SetSequencerRanks().
 958:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - Set ADC channel sampling time
 959:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *            Refer to function LL_ADC_SetChannelSamplingTime();
 960:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
 961:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @param  ADC_INJ_InitStruct Pointer to a @ref LL_ADC_INJ_InitTypeDef structure
 962:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   * @retval An ErrorStatus enumeration value:
 963:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - SUCCESS: ADC registers are initialized
 964:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   *          - ERROR: ADC registers are not initialized
 965:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c ****   */
 966:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.c **** ErrorStatus LL_ADC_INJ_Init(ADC_TypeDef *ADCx, LL_ADC_INJ_InitTypeDef *ADC_INJ_InitStruct)
